menu.version.line.1=§l§7Here you'll find info about the latest map update
menu.version.label=§2Map Version:
menu.version.line.2=§lUpdate 0.3.0 (in development)§r
menu.version.line.3=• New chat message look: "icon Label » text", no more color noise
menu.version.line.4=• Menus in one style: "Section » Subsection" titles, icons on buttons
menu.version.line.5=• New: "Ore Magnet" in Shop » Boosts — nearby items fly to you for 5 minutes
menu.version.line.6=• Hunger only drains in the PvP arena, the level pickaxe never breaks
menu.version.line.7=• Ores no longer drop experience orbs
menu.version.line.8=• Autosale no longer takes the last item without paying
menu.version.line.9=• Money is no longer taken when a boost or VIP purchase fails
menu.version.line.10=• Bank: whole amounts only, no transfers to yourself or offline players
menu.version.line.11=• Anti-cheat no longer removes VIP shop purchases
menu.version.line.12=• Fixed events, boosts, rebirth (max 5) and chat commands
menu.version.line.13=• Shop » Cosmetics for VIP coins: name and text color, particles around you, on death and when selling
menu.version.line.14=• VIP players show VIP coins above their head, !stats has a VIP coins line
menu.version.line.15=• New icons for the server menu, admin menu and coin
menu.version.line.16=• New commands: !color, !unfreeze, !unwarn, !debug and more — full list in !help
menu.version.line.17=• !emotes is a neat grid, !top vip_coins shows the top by VIP coins
menu.version.line.18=• The PvP arena no longer teleports you onto tree leaves
menu.version.line.19=• Achievements and challenges with rewards — Server menu » Achievements
menu.version.line.20=• Minigames (PvP: Last One Standing), a music switch in Settings, CPS check
menu.version.line.21=• Wipe with a summary, CPS above the hotbar in the arena, settings showing their current state
menu.version.line.22=• The Cave — the third location (levels 26–40): 10 pits in a U shape, pickaxes start again from wooden, a dome
menu.version.line.23=• VIP is now a separate status (from level 40), rebirth from level 25; rebirth keeps VIP coins
menu.version.line.24=• Shooting range: shoot targets with a bow for coins; the Wandering Trader's shop on the VIP island
menu.version.line.25=• Jail (!jail), reports (!report), timed bans and mutes
menu.version.line.26=• 12 new achievements, new promo codes; falling into the void takes you back to spawn

