## --- RULES ---
##   menu.rules.*
menu.rules.title=§l§8Server Menu » §r §8§lRules
menu.rules.header=§l§7Server Rules:
menu.rules.footer=§7By reading the rules you accept punishment for breaking them; not knowing the rules is no excuse. The third warning is a kick. Staff choose the length within the stated range depending on the situation.
menu.rules.line.1=§r§l1.§r§7 No spam or flood in chat: repeats, caps, gibberish §8• §cmute 5–15 min, again — 30 min
menu.rules.line.2=§r§l2.§r§7 No insulting players or staff, no attacks on relatives §8• §cmute 30–60 min, again — a warning
menu.rules.line.3=§r§l3.§r§7 No politics or religion, no stirring up hostility §8• §cmute 60 min, again — jail 30 min
menu.rules.line.4=§r§l4.§r§7 No pretending to be staff: other people's names and role prefixes in messages §8• §cwarning, again — kick
menu.rules.line.5=§r§l5.§r§7 No begging for resources, rights, creative, commands or resource packs §8• §cwarning, again — kick
menu.rules.line.6=§r§l6.§r§7 No advertising: links, streams, other servers and accounts §8• §cmute 60 min, again — kick
menu.rules.line.7=§r§l7.§r§7 No disturbing others: stalking, provoking, blocking mines and portals §8• §cjail 15–30 min
menu.rules.line.8=§r§l8.§r§7 No exploiting map bugs — report a bug you found to staff with !report §8• §cjail 30–60 min, again — ban
menu.rules.line.9=§r§l9.§r§7 No cheats, autoclickers or third-party clients §8• §cban
menu.rules.line.10=§r§l10.§r§7 No evading punishment: alt accounts, name changes §8• §cban
menu.rules.line.11=§r§l11.§r§7 No arguing with staff decisions in chat — send disagreement via !report §8• §cmute 15 min

