bot.guide.1=Hi, §e%1$s§f! I'm %2$s, this server's bot. Let me show you around.
bot.guide.2=Mine with the pickaxe in your first slot, then stand on a §6gold block§f — your ore sells itself for coins and XP.
bot.guide.3=Got enough XP for a level? Stand on the gold block again. New levels unlock new mines.
bot.guide.4=The item in your last slot is the server menu: shop, teleports, achievements and settings are there. Happy digging!
